{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Upgrade packages inside otter managed containers{R}{2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter syu     [options] [container...]{R}          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter upgrade [options] [container...]{R}          {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter syu my-box{R}                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter syu --all -r{R}                              {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter upgrade --all{R}                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter upgrade --running{R}                         {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Options:{R}                                        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Use all containers{R}               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Use rootful containers{R}           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--running{R} {2}┆{R} {4}-R{R}  {5}Only running containers{R}          {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                         {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}           {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                          {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{4}--root{R}{5}  Prefer '--root' over 'sudo otter'.{R}        {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}        Use 'preferences.sudo-program' for a{R}      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}        different escalator.{R}                      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Locked containers are skipped with a warning.{R}     {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}If all requested containers are locked, the{R}       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}command errors. Use 'otter unlock' first.{R}         {2}│{R}
{2}├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
